 encoding.dat              | Bin 0 -> 179670 bytes
 engines/scumm/charset.cpp | 118 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 engines/scumm/scumm.h     |   2 +-
 3 files changed, 96 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 encoding.dat

